⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
310 calories 33g protein (yes for the whole pint)😋🤤

Peanut Butter Cup Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my E-Book
Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Vanilla Protein Shake (I like the ones from @Raw Nutrition or @Nurri)
- 20-25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 32g Mini @Reeses Peanut Butter Cups (chopped)
310 cal 22g C, 12g F, 33g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
7. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped up Peanut Butter Cups
8. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

